  nameEnglish: Celestial Cyclone
  descriptionEnglish: These holy daggers were meant to be thrown separately, but
    some clever soul connected them together for double the fun! Now you can slice
    and dice your enemies with ease as they spin through the air, like a deadly fidget
    spinner!
  nameChinese: "\u5929\u5802\u65CB\u98CE"
  descriptionChinese: "\u8FD9\u4E9B\u795E\u5723\u7684\u5315\u9996\u539F\u672C\u662F\u5206\u522B\u6295\u63B7\u7684\uFF0C\u4F46\u662F\u4E00\u4E9B\u806A\u660E\u7684\u4EBA\u5C06\u5B83\u4EEC\u8FDE\u63A5\u5728\u4E00\u8D77\uFF0C\u8BA9\u4F60\u53EF\u4EE5\u5728\u5B83\u4EEC\u50CF\u81F4\u547D\u7684\u624B\u6307\u9640\u87BA\u4E00\u6837\u5728\u7A7A\u4E2D\u65CB\u8F6C\u65F6\u8F7B\u677E\u5730\u5207\u5272\u4F60\u7684\u654C\u4EBA!"
  namePortuguese: Ciclone Celestial
  descriptionPortuguese: "Estas adagas sagradas foram feitas para serem arremessadas
    separadamente, mas algu\xE9m esperto as conectou para dobrar a divers\xE3o! Agora,
    voc\xEA pode fatiar seus inimigos com facilidade enquanto elas giram pelo ar,
    como um fidget spinner mortal!"
  nameSpanish: "Cicl\xF3n Celestial"
  weaponDescriptionSpanish: "Estas dagas sagradas estaban destinadas a ser arrojadas
    por separado, \xA1pero alg\xFAn alma ingeniosa las conect\xF3 para duplicar la
    diversi\xF3n! Ahora puedes cortar y rebanar a tus enemigos con facilidad mientras
    giran por el aire, como un fidget spinner mortal!"
